WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.340
Hi, I'm Wallace. I've been in aviation for nearly 14 years.

2
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.400
I started with no aviation background and no clients,

3
00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:13.810
and I worked my way up to become one of the strongest brokers in APAC.

4
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.840
And now I'm starting my own brokerage.

5
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.180
As a broker, we have to find clients,

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.050
handle the inquiries,

7
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.900
source aircraft, generate quotations,

8
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.860
itineraries, contracts and even flight monitoring.

9
00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.960
We have to do everything ourselves, with no help.

10
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.180
So now I'm building Toy.

11
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.990
Why do I want to build Toy? Because I need an assistant.

12
00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.680
I need something to help me handle flights,

13
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.000
and do the repetitive work, so I can have more time

14
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.100
for myself, for my clients and for my family.

15
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.250
I hope Toy can help you too.
